      "title": {
        "en": "Exceptional and empathetic veterinary team"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Pet parents speak highly of the clinic's veterinarians and veterinary technicians, describing them as compassionate, knowledgeable, and patient. Reviewers frequently commend Dr. Broussard, Dr. Taylor, and Dr. Kurtz for their dedicated approach to diagnostics, routine wellness, and attentive care for senior pets."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "animals",
      "sentiment": "positive",
      "mentions": 10,
      "title": {
        "en": "Loving care for family animals"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Clients emphasize the genuine affection and tenderness shown to their dogs and cats during every visit. Pet owners describe patient handling of squirmy and nervous pets during blood draws, as well as attentive monitoring throughout complex dental surgeries and routine wellness examinations."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "communication",
      "sentiment": "positive",
      "mentions": 7,
      "title": {
        "en": "Clear guidance and collaborative planning"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Reviewers appreciate the transparent and informative communication from attending doctors. Clients note that veterinarians thoroughly explain complex diagnoses such as heart murmurs, provide multiple treatment options, and ensure pet owners feel fully informed and confident regarding recommended care plans."
      }
    }
  ],
